>\n      <\/tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Je n'ai pas de Box Internet<\/td>\n        <td>⛔ Ne fonctionne pas<\/td>\n        <td>📩 Alerte + Pilotage par <strong>SMS<\/strong><\/td>\n        <td>📱 Alerte + Pilotage complet par <strong>APP<\/strong> (Data) et <strong>SMS<\/strong><\/td>\n      <\/tr>\n    <\/tbody>\n  <\/table>\n\n  <p><strong>💡 Important :<\/strong><\/p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Pour bénéficier du mode GSM 4G, une carte SIM (non fournie) est nécessaire (Forfait Afone disponible sur notre site ou tout opérateur).<\/li>\n    <li>Les caméras ne fonctionnent qu'avec une connexion WiFi active.<\/li>\n  <\/ul>\n<\/div>","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":72,"divider":false,"narrow":false,"rounded":false}},"multicolumn_r8LRCm":{"type":"multicolumn","blocks":{"column_njApD3":{"type":"column","settings":{"show_border":false,"text_alignment":"center","text_alignment_mobile":"center","svg_html":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/958b5e1e-36cd-47db-93da-efc4b7f2d77c.jpg","image_ratio":"adapt","heading":"<strong>Vigilia<\/strong> : <strong>clavier physique intégré<\/strong>.","heading_size":"text-lg-2xl","text":"<p>Idéal si vous souhaitez une utilisation simple, sans tactile. Livrée en standard avec une caméra de surveillance.<\/p>","button_label":"Découvrir","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/systeme-dalarme-vigilia","button_style":"primary","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"column_KmbfVJ":{"type":"column","settings":{"show_border":false,"text_alignment":"center","text_alignment_mobile":"center","svg_html":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/8734bc42-ff99-47e9-97d1-34e38b0a4397.jpg","image_ratio":"adapt","heading":"<strong>Touch & Touch XL<\/strong>","heading_size":"text-lg-2xl","text":"<p>Écran <strong>tactile couleur <\/strong>(4,3” ou 7”). Interface intu