privée préservée<\/strong>","text":"<p>Vous êtes <strong>le seul à avoir accès à vos données<\/strong>.<\/p><p>Aucune télésurveillance externe, aucune captation vidéo par un tiers<\/p><p>Vous gardez le contrôle complet sur vos caméras, alertes et accessoires.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"column_tR4Dne":{"type":"column","settings":{"icon":"wrench","custom_icon":"","heading":"<strong>Installation facile et évolutive<\/strong>","text":"<p>Installation <strong>en 30 minutes<\/strong>, sans technicien.<\/p><p>Ajoutez jusqu’à <strong>200 accessoires<\/strong>(détecteurs, sirènes, caméras, volets connectés…).<\/p><p>Gérez tout via l’application gratuite<strong>Daewoo Home Connect<\/strong>.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}}},"block_order":["column_AypWYm","column_wFHFCT","column_tR4Dne"],"name":"t:sections.multicolumn-with-icons.name","settings":{"style":"with-background","columns":3,"text_alignment":"center","heading":"<strong>Pourquoi choisir une alarme Daewoo Security ?<\/strong>","heading_size":"title-md","heading_alignment":"text-center md:items-center","heading_tag":"h2","subheading":"","description":"","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"underline","highlighted_scribble":"circle","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_highlight":"#e11d48","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":72,"divider":false,"full_width":false,"rounded":false}},"image_with_text_3RDtgk":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_x83wRF":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Ils ont choisi Daewoo Security","heading_size":"title-md","heading_tag":"h2","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"text_9c6iD4":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Jean et Marie, 48 et 46 ans, ont protégé leur maison à la campagne avec le système <strong>Touch XL<\/strong>.<br\/><br\/>Découvrez <strong>leur configuration sur mesure<\/strong>, les détecteurs extérieurs installés et le coût global de leur solution.<\/p>","text_font":"body","text_size":"subtext-md","text_max_size":32,"text_line_height":1.6,"text_letter_spacing":0,"text_capitalize":false,"secondary_color":false,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"button_cPRHXL":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Voir leur configuration","button_link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/ils-ont-choisi-daewoo-security","button_style":"primary","button_size":"md","button_external":false,"button_icon":true}}},"block_order":["heading_x83wRF","text_9c6iD4","button_cPRHXL"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Capture_d_ecran_le_2025-10-30_a_13.45.18.png","image_height":"650px","image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","text_alignment":"left","content_position":"align-self-center","image_height_mobile":"auto","text_alignment_mobile":"left","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_background_2":"","gradient_background_2":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":72,"divider":false,"full_width":false,"rounded":false,"enable_parallax":true,"parallax_direction":"vertical"}},"custom_liquid_P7MEmQ":{"type":"custom-liquid","disabled":true,"name":"t:sections.custom-liquid.name","settings":{"liquid":"<style>\n  .section-assistant {\n    display: flex;\n    width: 100%;\n    min-height: 700px;\n  }\n\n  .col-iframe, .col-texte {\n    width: 50%;\n    padding: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .col-texte {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n\n  \/* Responsive mobile *\/\n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .section-assistant {\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    .col-iframe, .col-texte {\n      width: 100%;\n      padding: 10px;\n    }\n  }\n<\/style>\n\n<div class=\"section-assistant\">\n  <!-- Colonne texte -->\n  <div class=\"col-texte\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">Découvrez Léa, votre assistante virtuel.<\/h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">\n      Elle est là pour répondre à toutes vos questions et vous accompagner dans vos démarches.  \n      Pour obtenir une réponse rapide et précise, n’hésitez pas à formuler votre demande avec le plus de détails possible.  \n      <br><br>\n      <em>(Par exemple : Je ne sais pas quel modèle choisir entre le système Vigilia et touch)<\/em>\n    <\/p>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <!-- Colonne iframe -->\n  <div class=\"col-iframe\">\n    <iframe\n    src=\"https:\/\/www.chatbase.co\/chatbot-iframe\/PweqIHNtck_6MWthjeDjs\"\n    width=\"100%\"\n    style=\"height: 100%; min-height: 700px\"\n    frameborder=\"0\"\n><\/iframe>","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":72,"divider":false,"narrow":false,"rounded":false}},"rich_text_QaqUxU":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_tQy4yt":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>Quel accessoire choisir pour mon alarme ?<\/strong>","heading_size":"title-md","heading_tag":"h2","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}}},"block_order":["heading_tQy4yt"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.name","settings":{"text_alignment":"center","text_alignment_mobile":"center","heading":"","heading_size":"title-md","heading_alignment":"text-left md:items-end md:flex-row","heading_width":"small","heading_tag":"h2","subheading":"","description":"","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":0,"divider":false,"narrow":true,"rounded":false}},"image_with_text_Fzm4B6":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_drJpdz":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>Le contacteur de porte<\/strong>","heading_size":"title-md","heading_tag":"h2","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"text_6iceDm":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>C’est l’accessoire le plus courant, il s’installe sur la partie fixe et la partie ouvrante de votre porte ou fenêtre et va déclencher l’alarme en cas de séparation des 2 parties. En général, vous disposez d’une tolérance dans la distance entre les 2 parties de 5 ou 6 mm<\/p>","text_font":"body","text_size":"subtext-md","text_max_size":32,"text_line_height":1.6,"text_letter_spacing":0,"text_capitalize":false,"secondary_color":false,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}}},"block_order":["heading_drJpdz","text_6iceDm"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/WDS301_080aafc1-9fab-4d10-ad16-ccca23267926.png","image_height":"650px","image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","text_alignment":"left","content_position":"align-self-center","image_height_mobile":"auto","text_alignment_mobile":"left","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_background_2":"","gradient_background_2":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":72,"divider":false,"full_width":false,"rounded":false,"enable_parallax":true,"parallax_direction":"vertical"}},"image_with_text_AMAWU7":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_TB9Nfb":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>Le détecteur de vibration<\/strong>","heading_size":"title-md","heading_tag":"h2","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"text_MxjEh9":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Cet accessoire est pratique sur des surfaces vitrées comme des baies coulissantes. Celui-ci va se déclencher lorsqu’un choc est détecté. Il convient d’effectuer des tests de déclenchement avant l’installation définitive pour définir l’emplacement optimal ( sur l’encadrement ou la partie vitrée ).<\/p><p> <\/p>","text_font":"body","text_size":"subtext-md","text_max_size":32,"text_line_height":1.6,"text_letter_spacing":0,"text_capitalize":false,"secondary_color":false,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}}},"block_order":["heading_TB9Nfb","text_MxjEh9"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Copie_de_WIS502_3.png","image_height":"650px","image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","text_alignment":"left","content_position":"align-self-center","image_height_mobile":"auto","text_alignment_mobile":"left","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_background_2":"","gradient_background_2":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":72,"divider":false,"full_width":false,"rounded":false,"enable_parallax":true,"parallax_direction":"vertical"}},"image_with_text_RU3bcy":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_AM6MFh":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>Le Contacteur de porte \/ Détecteur de vibration 2 en 1<\/strong> ","heading_size":"title-md","heading_tag":"h2","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"text_KEMixy":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Cet accessoire de la gammeTouch\/Vigiliaest un concentré de technologie. En effet, grâce à ses 2 fonctions de détection, c’est un accessoire idéal pour des portes, baies vitréesou autres. Il va se déclencher soit en cas de choc, soit si les 2 parties du contacteur sontseparées.<\/p>","text_font":"body","text_size":"subtext-md","text_max_size":32,"text_line_height":1.6,"text_letter_spacing":0,"text_capitalize":false,"secondary_color":false,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}}},"block_order":["heading_AM6MFh","text_KEMixy"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/WDV301Final2-min.png","image_height":"650px","image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","text_alignment":"left","content_position":"align-self-center","image_height_mobile":"auto","text_alignment_mobile":"left","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_background_2":"","gradient_background_2":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":72,"divider":false,"full_width":false,"rounded":false,"enable_parallax":false,"parallax_direction":"vertical"}},"image_with_text_CiJxEY":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_LMkUbY":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>Le détecteur de mouvement<\/strong>","heading_size":"title-md","heading_tag":"h2","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"text_dwKtfQ":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Un couloir ? en haut d’un escalier ? un angle de pièce stratégique ? Définissez le meilleur emplacement pour installer un détecteur de mouvement. Celui-ci se déclenchera au passage d’une personne.Il existe également des versions pour l’extérieure qui vous permettront de déclencher l’alarme avant même que le voleur n’accède à votre maison.<\/p><p> <\/p>","text_font":"body","text_size":"subtext-md","text_max_size":32,"text_line_height":1.6,"text_letter_spacing":0,"text_capitalize":false,"secondary_color":false,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}}},"block_order":["heading_LMkUbY","text_dwKtfQ"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/WPS501_2.png","image_height":"650px","image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","text_alignment":"left","content_position":"align-self-center","image_height_mobile":"auto","text_alignment_mobile":"left","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_background_2":"","gradient_background_2":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":72,"divider":false,"full_width":false,"rounded":false,"enable_parallax":false,"parallax_direction":"vertical"}},"image_with_text_QFpp8X":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_xDEwbL":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>La barrière infrarouge<\/strong>","heading_size":"title-md","heading_tag":"h2","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"text_JJ8ytJ":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Le dernier née de la gammeTouch\/Vigilia. Cet accessoire se compose de 2 barrières qui communique entre elles via des faisceaux. Si les faisceaux sont coupés( passaged’un individu ou arrachage d’unebarrière ), alors l’alarme se déclenchera. Idéal pour une allée par exemple avec une installationdiscrète.<\/p><p> <\/p>","text_font":"body","text_size":"subtext-md","text_max_size":32,"text_line_height":1.6,"text_letter_spacing":0,"text_capitalize":false,"secondary_color":false,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}}},"block_order":["heading_xDEwbL","text_JJ8ytJ"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Visuellifestyleaccessoires_6_11e1073b-5e8d-4ad6-ba0f-50c220ec1d43.png","image_height":"650px","image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","text_alignment":"left","content_position":"align-self-center","image_height_mobile":"auto","text_alignment_mobile":"left","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_background_2":"","gradient_background_2":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":72,"divider":false,"full_width":false,"rounded":false,"enable_parallax":false,"parallax_direction":"vertical"}},"rich_text_RxBCNW":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_EpzngC":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>Quelle caméra choisir ?<\/strong>","heading_size":"title-md","heading_tag":"h2","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}}},"block_order":["heading_EpzngC"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.name","settings":{"text_alignment":"center","text_alignment_mobile":"center","heading":"","heading_size":"title-md","heading_alignment":"text-left md:items-end md:flex-row","heading_width":"small","heading_tag":"h2","subheading":"","description":"","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":0,"divider":false,"narrow":true,"rounded":false}},"image_with_text_YVCxjJ":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_P9GrQ7":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Caméra pour l’intérieure :","heading_size":"title-md","heading_tag":"h2","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"text_thDVfA":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Dans la gamme Daewoo, toutes les caméras intérieures fonctionnent sur une alimentation secteur et en Wifi. Elles disposent de la vision nocturne, de la détection de mouvement et d’un système audio pour écouter ce qu’il se passe. Suivant le modèle, vous pourrez balayer toute une pièce grâce à la tête motorisée ( Modèles disponibles : IF501, IP501, IP506P ).<\/p>","text_font":"body","text_size":"subtext-md","text_max_size":32,"text_line_height":1.6,"text_letter_spacing":0,"text_capitalize":false,"secondary_color":false,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"button_yyBiPh":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Voir les caméras intérieures","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/cameras-interieures","button_style":"primary","button_size":"md","button_external":false,"button_icon":true}}},"block_order":["heading_P9GrQ7","text_thDVfA","button_yyBiPh"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ip506P_d369dd17-3f2d-4c98-badc-9d72b9cc9fe8.png","image_height":"650px","image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","text_alignment":"left","content_position":"align-self-center","image_height_mobile":"auto","text_alignment_mobile":"left","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_background_2":"","gradient_background_2":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":72,"divider":false,"full_width":false,"rounded":false,"enable_parallax":true,"parallax_direction":"vertical"}},"image_with_text_jJpkwe":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_mYQbbD":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Caméra pour l’extérieure : ","heading_size":"title-md","heading_tag":"h2","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"text_NPUArk":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Première interrogation à avoir, avez-vous une alimentation électrique à l’extérieure ? Si oui, alors la EP506 est le modèle idéal. Grâce à sa tête motorisée et ses LED pour une vision nocturne en couleur, c’est la caméra idéale pour sécuriser votre jardin.<\/p><p>Sans alimentation électrique, ne vous inquiétez pas, nous avons ce qu’il vous faut. <\/p><p>Daewoo propose une gamme de caméras autonomes avec ou sans panneau solaire. Ces caméras s’installent en quelques minutes, à l’endroit souhaité, a partir du moment ou le Wifi est disponible. Le panneau solaire permet une alimentation en continu sans se soucier de recharger la caméra. ( Modèles disponibles : W502 ( fixe ), W509MW ou W512MW motorisée avec panneau solaire ).<\/p>","text_font":"body","text_size":"subtext-md","text_max_size":32,"text_line_height":1.6,"text_letter_spacing":0,"text_capitalize":false,"secondary_color":false,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"button_DYjyXK":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Voir les caméras extérieures","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/cameras-exterieures","button_style":"primary","button_size":"md","button_external":false,"button_icon":true}}},"block_order":["heading_mYQbbD","text_NPUArk","button_DYjyXK"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Visuellifestyleaccessoires_1.png","image_height":"650px","image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","text_alignment":"left","content_position":"align-self-center","image_height_mobile":"auto","text_alignment_mobile":"left","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_background_2":"","gradient_background_2":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":72,"divider":false,"full_width":false,"rounded":false,"enable_parallax":true,"parallax_direction":"vertical"}},"main-page":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"custom_css":[".page-width {max-width: 100% !important; width: 100% !important; margin: 0 !important; padding: 20px !important;}"],"settings":{"heading_size":"title-sm","heading_alignment":"text-left","heading_tag":"h1","text_size":"text-base","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":120,"divider":false,"narrow":true,"rounded":false}}},"order":["rich_text_Frfk7D","custom_liquid_9bKcyQ","rich_text_iCkUrw","multicolumn_hKjzzt","pagefly_section_W7ahAY","image_with_text_overlay_TUQQMC","rich_text_QgefVV","multicolumn_hUrKhj","custom_liquid_M9W9Mx","multicolumn_r8LRCm","rich_text_C3JUiM","multicolumn_with_icons_zPLM88","image_with_text_3RDtgk","custom_liquid_P7MEmQ","rich_text_QaqUxU","image_with_